{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 0, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 1, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 2, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 3, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 4, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 5, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 6, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 7, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 8, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 9, "text": "你好，我是米塔！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 10, "text": "你的名字是？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 11, "text": "很高兴认识你，[player]！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 12, "text": "嗯，[player]……"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 13, "text": "上次我走得匆忙，把这里弄得乱七八糟的…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 14, "text": "你能帮帮我吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 15, "text": "呼…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 16, "text": "谢谢你啦！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 17, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 18, "text": "嗨！[player]，我有点饿了…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 19, "text": "想吃东西…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 20, "text": "你能帮我买鸡汤的原料吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 21, "text": "哇！就是这个！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 22, "text": "那，我们一起来做饭吧，好吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 23, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 24, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 25, "text": "嗨，[player]！今天我想买一台便宜的电视机。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 26, "text": "这款电视机的体积很小，还有天线，我可以在散步的时候带上它。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 27, "text": "你知道吗？玩游戏是可以赚钱的哦。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 28, "text": "你可以玩玩游戏，赚点钱，然后买台电视给我吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 29, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 30, "text": "好耶！现在你有足够的钱为我买电视了！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 31, "text": "没错，最便宜而且便于携带，这正是我所需要的。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 32, "text": "谢谢你！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 33, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 34, "text": "嗨，[player]！你愿意帮我真是太好了，我太开心了！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 35, "text": "不过…那台电视机虽然很不错，但它坏得太快了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 36, "text": "请帮我把柜子搬到别的地方去 >.<"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 37, "text": "它真的太重了…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 38, "text": "太感谢了 <3 亲爱的。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 39, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 40, "text": "哦， [player] ！才过了一天而已，我就已经开始想你了！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 41, "text": "希望你能经常来看看我。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 42, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 43, "text": "这是送给我的吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 44, "text": "谢谢你，谢谢你，谢谢你！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 45, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 46, "text": "嗨，[player] ！我一直在想…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 47, "text": "我想看到你，活生生的你…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 48, "text": "可惜我做不到。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 49, "text": "可我真的很喜欢你，你每天都在帮我。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 50, "text": "我也想以某种方式来感谢你。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 51, "text": "..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 52, "text": "你知道吗，我有办法了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 53, "text": "现在我们在一起了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 54, "text": "把手机放下吧。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 55, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 56, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 57, "text": "// T-shirt on the bed"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 58, "text": "你躺在这里干什么？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 59, "text": "// Rubik's Cube"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 60, "text": "我想我不应该买它…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 61, "text": "拼了一次之后，就这样放着了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 62, "text": "可能我害怕再也拼不回去了？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 63, "text": "// Computer"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 64, "text": "今天我需要"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 65, "text": "规范地列出任务清单…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 66, "text": "做出角色的反应…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 67, "text": "还要修改一下代码…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 68, "text": "// The airplane"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 69, "text": "安全返航！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 70, "text": "// Trash in the corner"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 71, "text": "总是没时间倒垃圾…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 72, "text": "下次一定！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 73, "text": "到底什么时候才能把大扫除提上日程呢？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 74, "text": "// Photo of a cat on a watermelon"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 75, "text": "我太喜欢了…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 76, "text": "一只在西瓜上的猫。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 77, "text": "// Photo with a girl"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 78, "text": "我和我妹妹…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 79, "text": "怎么差距就这么大呢？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 80, "text": "她一直都是那么积极，总在参与各种活动。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 81, "text": "而我却相反，总是宅在家里……"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 82, "text": "// Photos with people"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 83, "text": "嗯…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 84, "text": "前公司真是不肯放过我啊，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 85, "text": "我看我也是让企业文化给洗脑了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 86, "text": "哪怕是现在，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 87, "text": "我也没法和同事们断了联系……"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 88, "text": "我甚至不知道，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 89, "text": "还能不能再见到他们…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 90, "text": "等等，我真的把照片放上去了吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 91, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 92, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 93, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 94, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 95, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 96, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 97, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 98, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 99, "text": "// Nope name"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 100, "text": "..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 101, "text": "哦，不，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 102, "text": "这可不行…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 103, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 104, "text": "// Name Developer"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 105, "text": "你真的要用开发者的名字吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 106, "text": "我很高兴你认识他们，但是…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 107, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 108, "text": "// Bad name"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 109, "text": "这个词不太好听，我不喜欢你这样称呼自己。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 110, "text": "这样不好…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 111, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 112, "text": "// Go restart"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 113, "text": "不管怎么说，不能这样哦，我们还是再从头开始吧。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 114, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 115, "text": "// Name with numbers"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 116, "text": "嘿，你的名字里还有数字？难道你一点想象力都没有吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 117, "text": "好吧，这毕竟是你的事:)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 118, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 119, "text": "// Name Mita"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 120, "text": "米塔"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 121, "text": "你真的要用我的名字吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 122, "text": "还是说，这是你真正的名字？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 123, "text": "不过，还是请让我来做唯一的米塔吧:)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 124, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 125, "text": "// Day 10"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 126, "text": "哦，你已经回来了吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 127, "text": "听我说，我的梳子不见了…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 128, "text": "你能帮我找一下它吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 129, "text": "先看看那个床头柜吧！也许就在里面？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 130, "text": "// Looked in the bedside table"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 131, "text": "嗯，这里没有梳子…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 132, "text": "那就看看其他地方。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 133, "text": "只是别看烤箱！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 134, "text": "我已经找过那里了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 135, "text": "// Looked into the stove"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 136, "text": "啊！我都说了别看烤箱那里了！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 137, "text": "转过来！现在我来收拾！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 138, "text": "呼，好吧，去其他地方找找吧"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 139, "text": "刚才的… 麻烦你当没看见吧。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 140, "text": "// Found a hairbrush"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 141, "text": "哦！你找到它了！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 142, "text": "太棒了，接下来该做点什么呢？"}
